        "title": "Guang Khrista puan pui nung",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Guang khrista puan puinung kandih khou ganmei nai,",
            "Bethlehem kailuang lakhou munrim gaimei puangthe;",
            "Ganchuanga !@9 ata duanglou na,",
            "Bethlehem namdai gai khou kaguang ta kalum ni.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Kaoliangmei khou (2),",
            "Raguang himdai mei sudiu;",
            "(2x)",
            "A.... men, A...men,",
            "Raguang himdai na bamdiu,",
            "A ....men.",
            "",
            "2. Bethlehem namdai gaimei gailiang singmei e,",
            "Nang janta kandih mei!@9 he mukei thui makge;",
            "Nang khou !@9na tingkauh guang na puan,",
            "Mary !@9 puan bammei Immanuel ta hou ni.",
            "",
            "3. Khrista ariu dat mei hei Bethlehem pan ne,",
            "Hou nie tingkauh guangna kei puanlou puibam tei;",
            "Neila e tingkauh banchra lukhuan,",
            "Alung khou ninga bamme amu dat jat lak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
